  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Port Digitalization Technical Assistance, through HudsonAnalytix, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Port Sector Digitalization Technical Assistance is to support the Honduran Maritime Chamber of Commerce (in Spanish, the Cmara de Comercio Martima de Honduras) to provide the Honduran port sector with a roadmap to implement new digital technologies. These digital technologies would optimize the flow of traffic and goods and improve the quality of maritime services by maximizing efficiency, reducing costs, and improving port safety and security.</narrative>
  </description>
